 >>[2026-10-12 21:02] decide — Creator asked how particle diversity and semantic value could be studied. Planned a value lens by key, surface kind and slot, the census reading .agents, hover measures by lift, a study shelf beside the registry, and fragments that reach plan names, which are what plans cite.
