 >>[2026-10-12 21:31] observe — With .agents read: all 282 .agents .spw files pass the syntax validator (0 failed, 13 warnings); spw census . grows to 1322 files. Removing the exclusion showed the census and lint also walked .claude/worktrees (1734 gitignored copies, most of 1034 duplicate anchors) and release/; both now skip what the language server skips, and the census reads 1359 files with 80 duplicate anchors. Plan tags such as merge_risks: [#hot_file] count as noise marks, which ~[noise_lint] must tell apart from underspecified marks.
 >>[2026-10-12 21:31] decide — Creator finds case, mood and aspect poorly named. Opened ?[aim_names] with the glossary's holds and fails, the LSP's anchor, lens and intent, and the stance-versus-aim mismatch of aspect; ~[aim_names] renames across seed, LSP, census and canon if the creator settles it.
