 .[anchor_outline](c4c3e9c1): "&[lsp] — the outline lists anchors, not the whole header stack"
 ~[lattice_registry]: ".[canon] — particle-lattice registry (.spw/registries/directive-lattice.spw): stance×aim cells, census counts, header particle stack, glossary lead (particle=family; anchor/lens/focus=decided aims; deixis/case/mood=current code); pattern refactors user-gated"
 ~[noise_lint]: "^seed[census] — comment-filtered noise lint: orphan deixis, unbound case, boundary-less # marks (the 1527-mark census dominated by #-comment continuations must drop to the real residue)"
