 .[census_sees_plans](a4e548d3): "&[cli] — read-only walkers read .agents, and census and lint skip worktree copies"
 ~[particle_value_lens]: "^seed[census] — --value: per case key, by kind of surface and by slot (header stack, frame key, body), its uses, values, bits and top share, the bits left once the file's glyph, path and slug are known, and for anchors their citations in and the tools that read them"
 ~[particle_hover_measures]: "&[lsp] — hover on a particle shows its measures where it sits (bits in this slot, what it repeats, citations, readers) and co-occurrence by lift, not the corpus totals and raw co-occurrence it shows today"
 ~[particle_study_shelf]: ".[canon] — after ~[lattice_registry]: a study shelf in the registry: each key's measured value beside a felt column the creator fills (keep, retire, give it a job), the objective and subjective shape of the quest's shelves.spw"
 ~[aim_names]: "vocab[seed,lsp,canon] — the aims are anchor (#>), lens (#:) and focus (#!) across lexer comments, census labels, LSP kinds (intent becomes focus), selectors, glossary and registry; old names stay as aliases for a release; the ~# stance follows ?[stance_name]"
}

